{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（10日）上午9時24分，警方接獲多人報案，指域多利道550號碧瑤灣一名男子揮刀斬人，至少有2人受傷，包括一名女傭及一名保安。案件列作傷人，警方正調查事件，並正追緝疑兇。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下涉案利刀。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163422222644416512758346.jpeg/Y35KTSULs2nEVN114GtNf31MqEpMmocq3ueW7vvnlu4\"/><figcaption>現場遺下涉案利刀。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉案男疑犯被帶上警車。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163422220022845440831264.jpeg/qSDcRdtwZqvFpEayRv4baDOrQEWtyKZ6PAS4IhkEuCI\"/><figcaption>涉案男疑犯被帶上警車。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名保安員受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163422217426440192170649.jpeg/2tgjK7VmINfYbF31BVhzyjazJPt5kX2Q5jAOgcMwDoE\"/><figcaption>一名保安員受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薄扶林域多利道550號碧瑤灣。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251229/1082236214485979136274109.jpeg/uCLqEMIIiYrHxJcysX1CdCJUHoGAzC4wAXbfxyt238c\"/><figcaption>薄扶林域多利道550號碧瑤灣。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西區警署。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221114/668773867955425280136724.jpeg/sXgRN0TwmVFYNntCRYA8_lITE4IKQHGw_u0QgP7tEIA\"/><figcaption>西區警署。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T01:53:43.620030+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}